    "translation_description": "La progressione si azzera ogni \u003Chex:020603120303\u003E\u003Chex:020942DDFF0753756E646179FF074D6F6E646179FF0854756573646179FF0A5765646E6573646179FF095468757273646179FF07467269646179FF09536174757264617903\u003Ealle \u003Chex:020821DBFF1D020919DB02030405060708090A0B0C0D02030405060708090A0B0C030D03\u003E \u003Chex:020810E0DB0DFF05702E6D2EFF05612E6D2E03\u003E (ora terrestre)."
  },
  "27": {
